{"title":"Cypress","slug":"Cypress","pageid":5134,"revid":21953,"timestamp":"2026-06-28T15:09:36Z","lastEditor":"Ilovechocolateyk","categories":["Trees"],"infobox":{"type":"Wood","fields":[{"label":"title","value":"Cypress"},{"label":"Island","value":"Ferwater"},{"label":"Hardness","value":"?"},{"label":"Log","value":"$?/stud"},{"label":"Sanded","value":"$?/stud"},{"label":"Planked","value":"$?/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"?"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"textures","text":"Textures"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n \n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"10\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Hexagon Incorrect\">Hexagon Incorrect</span></span>\n</td>\n<td><p><span>This page may contain <i>missing</i> or <i>inaccurate</i> information!</span><br>\n</p><p><span>Certain information in this page is missing or may contain inaccurate information. If you can cite where this particular information comes from, please add a citation - especially with percent calculations! The list following this notice denotes important potential inaccuracies and omissions.\n</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Cypress</b> tree is one of the various trees that can be found in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ferwater/\">Ferwater</a>. It appears as a pretty tall light brown-russet tree, with hanging strands of light yellow or beige material from it's branches, it's trunk widens at the base into stilt-like roots.\n</p><p>Like every other material in-game, it can be used to complete schematics.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"textures\">Textures</h2><p>\nThe various textures of the <b>Cypress</b> in its raw/log, sanded, and planked states.</p><div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"9f78881edab3d290d143462d0cbaa0a9\" data-seq-no=\"1\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"CypressLogT-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"